@startuml
start

:Firefighter submits unavailability for a date/time range;

:System registers and stores unavailability period;

:Duty Chief attempts to assign firefighter to a shift in that interval;

:System executes automatic eligibility check;

if (Is unavailability declared in that period? (RN06)) then (Yes)
  :System **blocks** assignment;
  :Displays error message to Duty Chief:
  "Cannot assign: Unavailability declared by user";
else (No)
  :System allows assignment to shift;
endif

stop
@enduml